@Tareas.MinimalApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5223

### Listar todas
GET {{Tareas.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/tareas
Accept: application/json

### Obtener por Id
GET {{Tareas.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/tareas/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear
POST {{Tareas.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/tareas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Regar las plantas",
  "completada": false
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{Tareas.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/tareas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Comprar leche y pan",
  "completada": true
}

### Eliminar
DELETE {{Tareas.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/tareas/2

### Documento OpenAPI
GET {{Tareas.MinimalApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
